## O que mudou

- aumenta e corrige a área de toque das categorias no painel;
- sincroniza itens esgotados entre painel, API e cardápio do cliente;
- impede pedidos de itens esgotados também no servidor;
- adiciona Dois Queijos (muçarela e Catupiry) por R$ 14,00;
- aplica fotos ilustrativas WebP e aprimora o design mobile do cardápio;
- limita o atendimento a segunda–sexta e atualiza Jd. Souza para sexta-feira, removendo-o da terça;
- valida dia, bairro e disponibilidade no backend.

## Impacto

O cardápio fica mais fácil de usar no celular, respeita as rotas por dia e impede que clientes selecionem produtos indisponíveis.

## Validação

- sintaxe do frontend e Apps Script;
- regras de terça, sexta e fim de semana;
- disponibilidade/esgotamento;
- layout mobile 390×844 sem rolagem horizontal.

## Summary

Corrects the exact-main RC7 managed proof failure without broadening GitHub Actions into the owner billing account.

- records failed exact-main run `30210742617/1` on `main@1c6acd7972caca838f27b4e5c4a521c92cbfc7c4`;
- preserves that the failure occurred before Android key mutation, image build, Cloud Run Job creation or Firebase Test Lab;
- keeps `direkt-github-deployer` free of billing-account roles;
- has the owner bootstrap verify the real 1-unit budget directly, then publish non-secret project-label attestation metadata for amount, currency and UTC check time;
- makes the managed proof reject an attestation older than eight hours;
- permanently prohibits managed `gcloud billing budgets` access and billing viewer/admin/cost-manager grants;
- preserves service-identity OAuth, Android key restrictions, quotas, privacy/fallback controls and production/participant disablement.

## Validation

The branch must pass the RC7 permanent verifiers, shell syntax, full backend/regression matrix, review and a fresh owner bootstrap before merge. After merge, one exact-main managed run must prove backend Geocoding, Android Maps readiness and cleanup.

## Boundaries

No billing-account role is granted to CI. No backend API key, Maps secret, Cloud NAT, participant data, production Maps or RC8 runtime activation is introduced.
